'''EVA Unit-01''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. True Form added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] gains 100% chance to [[Survive|Survive]] a lethal strike, 30% chance to spawn a [[Surge Attack#Mini-Surge|Mini-Surge]] and [[Strengthen|strengthens]] by 150% at 50% health.

