==Evolution==
Evolves into '''EVA Unit-01 & Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Determined Unit-01 & Cat''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
EVA Unit-01 is a very well-rounded Uber overall. Its Strong Ability makes it particularly useful in [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[Zombie Outbreaks]] and more. EVA Unit-01 becomes exceptionally viable in sub-chapters past [[Suburbs of the Dead]] as encounters with [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] and a mix of [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] are more prevalent, particularly in [[Uncanny Legends]]. Due to the [[Strong Against|strong effect]], the unit is able withstand attacks from [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] while doing a fair bit of damage to them. EVA Unit-01 is ideal against melee threats that are prevalent among [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]]. When [[Strengthen|strengthened]], EVA Unit-01's damage significantly increases, compensating for its low base damage, especially in general use.

EVA Unit-01 also has [[Barrier Breaker]], which combined with its fast attack rate allows it to decimate many [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]], notably [[:Category:Enemies with Barriers|enemies with barriers]] such as [[UltraBaaBaa]] and [[Youcan]], able to shred hordes of them with terrifying ease.

==='''True Form'''===
EVA Unit-01 now has 100% chance [[Survive|survive a Lethal Strike]], a higher strengthen multiplier and may generate a [[Mini-Surge]]. The [[Strengthen]] multiplier is by far the best improvement due to offering extra damage, and the survive ability allows it to reposition, exploiting its range advantage for further destruction. On the other hand, the [[Mini-Surge]] is unreliable for dealing damage. It does hit much further than the unit itself, but only really sees applications in destroying enemy Barriers and will rarely damage them much apart from [[UltraBaaBaa]], so it only serves as an added bonus. Nevertheless, the former two extra attributes can somewhat justify its True Form cost with elusive materials, making it much better in all areas.

